# Local simulation outputs: everything here is disposable and stays untracked
# except the summary artefacts whitelisted below (CSV/TXT/PNG/PDF/JSON).
#
# NOTE: the root .gitignore excludes `examples/**/results/` as a whole, and a
# nested rule cannot re-include a path under an excluded parent directory.
# The committed summary tables in tables/ (the October 2026 files and the
# v2_* calibration/power tables with their provenance JSON) are therefore
# staged with `git add -f`; this file governs only once the root rule is
# lifted for this directory.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!README.md
!summary*.csv
!*.csv
!*.txt
!*.json
!*.png
!*.pdf
